(1274022, 163676, 23458, '<td valign="top">well you probably should have titled it "is it zee or zed" Either way, the colours here are great - good choice of subject, sadly, the shot is a bit out of focus and it would be a little better if you rotated the stairs just a little, so they were horizontal.</td>', 'well you probably should have titled it "is it zee or zed" Either way, the colours here are great - good choice of subject, sadly, the shot is a bit out of focus and it would be a little better if you rotated the stairs just a little, so they were horizontal.', '2005-04-06 05:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274027, 163469, 23458, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo - backlighting effect is great model is beautiful and the gritty door makes for a nice surrounding. Only qualms are the halo around the top of the hair caused by the light and I think you''ll probaby get disqualified for the copyright symbol on the bottom left - so far as I know they aren''t allowed.  Still, its a good shot, so I hope no one complains about that.</td>', 'I really like this photo - backlighting effect is great model is beautiful and the gritty door makes for a nice surrounding. Only qualms are the halo around the top of the hair caused by the light and I think you''ll probaby get disqualified for the copyright symbol on the bottom left - so far as I know they aren''t allowed.  Still, its a good shot, so I hope no one complains about that.', '2005-04-06 05:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
