(1274098, 162023, 30861, '<td valign="top">Composition: 8, Technical: 9, Appeal: 10, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 9<br/> <br/>Certainly ought to be a ribbon IMO. It''s arguably more of an "O" than a "Q" but that''s neither here nor there. Composition a bit static, sharpness a bit less than spot-on. Fine shot.<br/> <br/>Incidentally, since I was ranking this one very highly anyway, i used it to test the "voting tool" that someone has posted to the forum., to see how it worked. I don''t actually vote this mechanically, I do it a little more wholiistically. Your image struck a chord with me and i scored it very high :-)</td>', 'Composition: 8, Technical: 9, Appeal: 10, Challenge: 10, Overall Calculated Average Score: 9 Certainly ought to be a ribbon IMO. It''s arguably more of an "O" than a "Q" but that''s neither here nor there. Composition a bit static, sharpness a bit less than spot-on. Fine shot. Incidentally, since I was ranking this one very highly anyway, i used it to test the "voting tool" that someone has posted to the forum., to see how it worked. I don''t actually vote this mechanically, I do it a little more wholiistically. Your image struck a chord with me and i scored it very high :-)', '2005-04-06 06:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274101, 163677, 30861, '<td valign="top">Easily the most flawless image in this challenge, and an extraordinarilu striking one. I appreciate the seeing that went into finding this, and the purity of the colors, lighting &amp; composition.</td>', 'Easily the most flawless image in this challenge, and an extraordinarilu striking one. I appreciate the seeing that went into finding this, and the purity of the colors, lighting & composition.', '2005-04-06 06:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
