(1274309, 162403, 13879, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing you know this might cause a bit of a fuss! The image itself extremely disturbing &amp; thought provoking, so in that respect Kudos for achieving what you set out to do.  But I dont feel these were "accidental" letters, they were intended.  So to me  it doesnt really fit the challenge, but that doesnt stop it being a powerful image.  Good luck in this &amp; future challenges.</td>', 'I''m guessing you know this might cause a bit of a fuss! The image itself extremely disturbing & thought provoking, so in that respect Kudos for achieving what you set out to do.  But I dont feel these were "accidental" letters, they were intended.  So to me  it doesnt really fit the challenge, but that doesnt stop it being a powerful image.  Good luck in this & future challenges.', '2005-04-06 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
