(1274926, 163252, 19010, '<td valign="top">More ripples in the backgound water would have been nice, and maybe a slight color bump to bring out the greens and browns on the log. Thats about he onlything I can think of to improve this image. It''s interesting, fun to look at, crisp, and fits the challenge perfectly great job.</td>', 'More ripples in the backgound water would have been nice, and maybe a slight color bump to bring out the greens and browns on the log. Thats about he onlything I can think of to improve this image. It''s interesting, fun to look at, crisp, and fits the challenge perfectly great job.', '2005-04-06 14:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
