(1274944, 163537, 19010, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge pretty well I do do however feel that your DOF is too shallow. It''s not often I say this but I also think your photo needs to be a little more busy. While it may be a good shot and fits the challenge it lacks enough deatails and to make this photo interseting the lone plant is not enough to carry hte shot by itself. Not a bad shot it just lacks punch.</td>', 'Meets the challenge pretty well I do do however feel that your DOF is too shallow. It''s not often I say this but I also think your photo needs to be a little more busy. While it may be a good shot and fits the challenge it lacks enough deatails and to make this photo interseting the lone plant is not enough to carry hte shot by itself. Not a bad shot it just lacks punch.', '2005-04-06 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274947, 162403, 10261, '<td valign="top">Well, you certainly got my attention with this picture. To date I don''t think any other images here have caused my heart rate to increase dramatically.<br/> <br/>Since the challenge is "accidental letters" and these letters seem to be intentional (if unfortunate), I don''t really see how this meets the topic. For ''shock art'' this is certainly powerful, but probably of rather limited appeal (as are most items in said genre). Due to the polarizing nature of this shot, I''d expect it to do poorly on any challenge, even if it was on topic. If the designated theme was "desperation" or "hopelessness" or something like that I''d probably give this around a 7. The clear view of the girl''s face really adds a lot of impact to this shot. Anyway, this is a valiant effort but is unlikely to do well.</td>', 'Well, you certainly got my attention with this picture. To date I don''t think any other images here have caused my heart rate to increase dramatically. Since the challenge is "accidental letters" and these letters seem to be intentional (if unfortunate), I don''t really see how this meets the topic. For ''shock art'' this is certainly powerful, but probably of rather limited appeal (as are most items in said genre). Due to the polarizing nature of this shot, I''d expect it to do poorly on any challenge, even if it was on topic. If the designated theme was "desperation" or "hopelessness" or something like that I''d probably give this around a 7. The clear view of the girl''s face really adds a lot of impact to this shot. Anyway, this is a valiant effort but is unlikely to do well.', '2005-04-06 14:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1274949, 163504, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems a bit overexposed</td>', 'seems a bit overexposed', '2005-04-06 14:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
