(1274964, 162403, 5286, '<td valign="top">I rarely comment harshly on pictures, but this one is asking for it. The colors are dirty. I guess you are trying a pun on ''accidental''; if you are, it''s a poorly executed one. The worst part, I think, is that it doesn''t even make me cringe, despite being so gory (and I''m not exaclty braveheart); I guess it just fails to convey anything. <br/>If you really wanted the brown ribbon, there are better ways of asking for it. 1.</td>', 'I rarely comment harshly on pictures, but this one is asking for it. The colors are dirty. I guess you are trying a pun on ''accidental''; if you are, it''s a poorly executed one. The worst part, I think, is that it doesn''t even make me cringe, despite being so gory (and I''m not exaclty braveheart); I guess it just fails to convey anything. If you really wanted the brown ribbon, there are better ways of asking for it. 1.', '2005-04-06 14:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
