(1275048, 163413, 19010, '<td valign="top">Interesting shadows.  This fits the challenge well  the only complaint I have is he bird in the background. Its badly out of focus. Yet in focus enough to have the veiwer trying to see the background. I feel your DOF should have been either shorter making it just a shadowy figure or deeper allowing the veiwer to enjoy the second bird in all it''s splendor. As is I find it unapealing .. Otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Interesting shadows.  This fits the challenge well  the only complaint I have is he bird in the background. Its badly out of focus. Yet in focus enough to have the veiwer trying to see the background. I feel your DOF should have been either shorter making it just a shadowy figure or deeper allowing the veiwer to enjoy the second bird in all it''s splendor. As is I find it unapealing .. Otherwise great shot.', '2005-04-06 14:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1275051, 163524, 34192, '<td valign="top">What the heck is that?  I think this image would be greatly improved with the grass blurred.  Right now it is in competition  things, whatever they are.  Excellent representation of the letter W though.</td>', 'What the heck is that?  I think this image would be greatly improved with the grass blurred.  Right now it is in competition  things, whatever they are.  Excellent representation of the letter W though.', '2005-04-06 14:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
