(1275116, 162403, 19010, '<td valign="top">Who cares what other may think. I love it. Powerfull image, itstrikes emotion into anyone who sees it. Strong, story, strong message, and very emotional shot. This is also very well done. It looks realistic. The obscure andles and lighting are perfect for this image it is in crisp focus and the colors are just right. Thanks for having the guts to stand up against the masses and watch your score probably plummit. This is truely art.. not many shots manage tobring emotion from there veiwers beyond "thats ineresting" or " ohh thats pretty. I must however complain that this does not fit the challenge. I fail to see the accedental letters. This would have been a 10 but as is i just can''t justify it. Once again thanks.</td>', 'Who cares what other may think. I love it. Powerfull image, itstrikes emotion into anyone who sees it. Strong, story, strong message, and very emotional shot. This is also very well done. It looks realistic. The obscure andles and lighting are perfect for this image it is in crisp focus and the colors are just right. Thanks for having the guts to stand up against the masses and watch your score probably plummit. This is truely art.. not many shots manage tobring emotion from there veiwers beyond "thats ineresting" or " ohh thats pretty. I must however complain that this does not fit the challenge. I fail to see the accedental letters. This would have been a 10 but as is i just can''t justify it. Once again thanks.', '2005-04-06 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1);
