(1275514, 162403, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that you''ve already been told plenty of times that your picture is disturbing and inappropriate -- maybe that was what you were going for ??  So, rather than say that again, I''ll just say I feel more of a sense of compassion for whatever is going on in your life  that would make a picture like this seem appealing.    It makes me feel more like praying than condemning, if that makes sense.</td>', 'I''m guessing that you''ve already been told plenty of times that your picture is disturbing and inappropriate -- maybe that was what you were going for ??  So, rather than say that again, I''ll just say I feel more of a sense of compassion for whatever is going on in your life  that would make a picture like this seem appealing.    It makes me feel more like praying than condemning, if that makes sense.', '2005-04-06 17:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
