(1276811, 163578, 36114, '<td valign="top">i don''t even know why i love it.  maybe the finger pointing and the illusion of it being at the tyre</td>', 'i don''t even know why i love it.  maybe the finger pointing and the illusion of it being at the tyre', '2005-04-07 07:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1276812, 163396, 27845, '<td valign="top">The letter is very clear and easily found. I like how you found it between the bricks, because it''s actually the crop and framing that makes a letter out ofa pattern. The light should be stronger. 7.</td>', 'The letter is very clear and easily found. I like how you found it between the bricks, because it''s actually the crop and framing that makes a letter out ofa pattern. The light should be stronger. 7.', '2005-04-07 07:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
