(1276823, 163433, 27845, '<td valign="top">Good DOF. Why does the mountain looks so smooth? Nice detail on the wood though. The crop feels too tight, but I understand you had to cut off the wood fence to the left and right. 7.</td>', 'Good DOF. Why does the mountain looks so smooth? Nice detail on the wood though. The crop feels too tight, but I understand you had to cut off the wood fence to the left and right. 7.', '2005-04-07 07:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1276825, 163455, 27845, '<td valign="top">The O is too obvious a letter for me, as it can be found almost anywhere. Circles are common in everyday life. Your DOF is not so good, the background is too important to be out of focus. You need a higher aperture. 4.</td>', 'The O is too obvious a letter for me, as it can be found almost anywhere. Circles are common in everyday life. Your DOF is not so good, the background is too important to be out of focus. You need a higher aperture. 4.', '2005-04-07 07:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1276826, 161461, 27845, '<td valign="top">I like the textures and the colour, but the crop is odd. 7.</td>', 'I like the textures and the colour, but the crop is odd. 7.', '2005-04-07 07:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
