(1277148, 163416, 31211, '<td valign="top">Though you have a very simple and not so interesting subject, you''ve managed to take a great, sharp and very detailed shot. I think you made the right option in turning this to b&amp;w. Nice job.</td>', 'Though you have a very simple and not so interesting subject, you''ve managed to take a great, sharp and very detailed shot. I think you made the right option in turning this to b&w. Nice job.', '2005-04-07 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
