(1277161, 162723, 19010, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the photo and love Da Vinci''s work. I wouldn''t say however thatths was an accedental letter. He was quite familiar with ratios, angles, and symbols. I would say that to prove his opinions on these areas was why he drew the scetch to start with.. Didn''t meen to lecture but felt like I should explain when I say.. It dosn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'I enjoy the photo and love Da Vinci''s work. I wouldn''t say however thatths was an accedental letter. He was quite familiar with ratios, angles, and symbols. I would say that to prove his opinions on these areas was why he drew the scetch to start with.. Didn''t meen to lecture but felt like I should explain when I say.. It dosn''t meet the challenge.', '2005-04-07 12:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
