(1277197, 163485, 6668, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, however as far as the challenge goes, I would have put the name of the letter in the title so people knew just what to look for, no letters overly stand out to me in this shot.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, however as far as the challenge goes, I would have put the name of the letter in the title so people knew just what to look for, no letters overly stand out to me in this shot.', '2005-04-07 12:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
