(1277597, 163440, 19010, '<td valign="top">hey isn''t this shot illigal now? no fair.. :) Nice shot I wouls like to have it a little brighter allowing me to see to see more of the details.. then again I have never been there so I don''t know what color it is to start with..  I do like the angles and the perspective... all in a its a pretty good shot.. 7</td>', 'hey isn''t this shot illigal now? no fair.. :) Nice shot I wouls like to have it a little brighter allowing me to see to see more of the details.. then again I have never been there so I don''t know what color it is to start with..  I do like the angles and the perspective... all in a its a pretty good shot.. 7', '2005-04-07 16:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277601, 163623, 19010, '<td valign="top">hmm intersting to look at  nice colors, crisp image, exciting, but I don''t feel that it realy met the challenge. I can see the Z but it''s a little weak IMO. Other that that this is a great image.. Nice job</td>', 'hmm intersting to look at  nice colors, crisp image, exciting, but I don''t feel that it realy met the challenge. I can see the Z but it''s a little weak IMO. Other that that this is a great image.. Nice job', '2005-04-07 16:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277607, 163612, 19010, '<td valign="top">Decent photo that fits the challenge however Its not very exciting to me... I tryed to see this as maybe an advertizing photo for a pipeline or somthing but... still I can''t see any real impact.. Well shot with crisp lines..... just not exciting.</td>', 'Decent photo that fits the challenge however Its not very exciting to me... I tryed to see this as maybe an advertizing photo for a pipeline or somthing but... still I can''t see any real impact.. Well shot with crisp lines..... just not exciting.', '2005-04-07 16:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277616, 162431, 19010, '<td valign="top">Ok one that made me smile.. Letters are obvious and fit the challenge perfectly.. not only did you find and accidental letter but the whole word.. This alone would have given you a 5.. But that wasn''t enough for you... no  you had to have great tones and shadows, lots of texture, and nice crisp focus. Fun photo, nice to look at, and technicaly wonderfull.. great job hope to see this one in the top 10.</td>', 'Ok one that made me smile.. Letters are obvious and fit the challenge perfectly.. not only did you find and accidental letter but the whole word.. This alone would have given you a 5.. But that wasn''t enough for you... no  you had to have great tones and shadows, lots of texture, and nice crisp focus. Fun photo, nice to look at, and technicaly wonderfull.. great job hope to see this one in the top 10.', '2005-04-07 16:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277618, 162382, 19010, '<td valign="top">very well done the subject was not very exciting but you managed to add a bit of life to it with the soft water and shadows well done..</td>', 'very well done the subject was not very exciting but you managed to add a bit of life to it with the soft water and shadows well done..', '2005-04-07 16:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277620, 163665, 19010, '<td valign="top">the lighting on the is way to harsh alot of the image is burned out. Wich is realy killing you colors and texture. It fits the challenge well and has alot of potential.. Looks like this was shot in direct sunlight however.. But maybe switching this to B&amp;W might help bring out some of the little details.</td>', 'the lighting on the is way to harsh alot of the image is burned out. Wich is realy killing you colors and texture. It fits the challenge well and has alot of potential.. Looks like this was shot in direct sunlight however.. But maybe switching this to B&W might help bring out some of the little details.', '2005-04-07 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277622, 163657, 19010, '<td valign="top">intersting.. accidental.... no probably not you made a sphere into an O..  otherwise this is a pretty nice shot.. Lots of great details and shadow. Great shot.. but a little weak in meeting the challenge.</td>', 'intersting.. accidental.... no probably not you made a sphere into an O..  otherwise this is a pretty nice shot.. Lots of great details and shadow. Great shot.. but a little weak in meeting the challenge.', '2005-04-07 16:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277631, 163514, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s more of a J than a Y, but a good pic none the less</td>', 'It''s more of a J than a Y, but a good pic none the less', '2005-04-07 16:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277667, 161647, 15810, '<td valign="top">Well spotted, nice crsp image with good colours DOF and texture.</td>', 'Well spotted, nice crsp image with good colours DOF and texture.', '2005-04-07 16:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277668, 163583, 15810, '<td valign="top">I expect most commenters will say this but teh lump of concrete bottom right ruins the shot which should have been about clean lines.</td>', 'I expect most commenters will say this but teh lump of concrete bottom right ruins the shot which should have been about clean lines.', '2005-04-07 16:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1277669, 161598, 15810, '<td valign="top">great capture in very tough lighting conditions.</td>', 'great capture in very tough lighting conditions.', '2005-04-07 16:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
