(1277672, 162005, 15810, '<td valign="top">In a challenge where a 640 pixel by 640 pixel image at 150kB is allowed, Your submission at 270 X 179 pixels and a whopping 9Kb doesnt do your subject or yourself any justice.</td>', 'In a challenge where a 640 pixel by 640 pixel image at 150kB is allowed, Your submission at 270 X 179 pixels and a whopping 9Kb doesnt do your subject or yourself any justice.', '2005-04-07 16:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
