(1277690, 162042, 32378, '<td valign="top">The shape of the letter I think is intended to be the letter "L" and doesn''t meet the challange.  Also all the shadows are very distracting.</td>', 'The shape of the letter I think is intended to be the letter "L" and doesn''t meet the challange.  Also all the shadows are very distracting.', '2005-04-07 17:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
