(1277723, 162082, 32378, '<td valign="top">I see the S.  However the overal picture seems to be lacking something, perhaps it is the coloration.  Sky doesn''t look the right color.</td>', 'I see the S.  However the overal picture seems to be lacking something, perhaps it is the coloration.  Sky doesn''t look the right color.', '2005-04-07 17:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
