(1277732, 163548, 32378, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems harsh. not much contast between the branch or tree and the background.  It may have been better to not put the letter dead center in middle of the picture.</td>', 'Lighting seems harsh. not much contast between the branch or tree and the background.  It may have been better to not put the letter dead center in middle of the picture.', '2005-04-07 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
