(1277753, 162955, 32378, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Too bad it was such a sunny day caused a lighting headache.  I would have tried to lessen the depth of field so that the things behind the girl were more out of focus.  Maybe bring her in closer to the log.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Too bad it was such a sunny day caused a lighting headache.  I would have tried to lessen the depth of field so that the things behind the girl were more out of focus.  Maybe bring her in closer to the log.', '2005-04-07 17:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
