(1277769, 162565, 32378, '<td valign="top">A little to over satuarted.  I''m wondering if a different angle would have resulted in a more interesting shot.</td>', 'A little to over satuarted.  I''m wondering if a different angle would have resulted in a more interesting shot.', '2005-04-07 17:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
