(1278338, 163686, 21367, '<td valign="top">Wow sure looks like BURT (big ugly red thing)  has someone has been in my neighborhood, actually I work just a couple blocks up the hill...<br/> <br/>Very cool shot, looks like you got some O''s in there as well.  I might have cropped it a little tighter...at least on the right side...it gets a little busy on the right and draws my attention that direction.  Good Shot.</td>', 'Wow sure looks like BURT (big ugly red thing)  has someone has been in my neighborhood, actually I work just a couple blocks up the hill... Very cool shot, looks like you got some O''s in there as well.  I might have cropped it a little tighter...at least on the right side...it gets a little busy on the right and draws my attention that direction.  Good Shot.', '2005-04-08 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
