(1278372, 163649, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the "D''s," but the composition isn''t quite what it could be. Maybe if you had zeroed in on the biggest one in front with the trees in the center and cropped out the others, it would have been more special. Just a thought. It''s still interesting, though, as is. Nice color and clarity.</td>', 'I love the "D''s," but the composition isn''t quite what it could be. Maybe if you had zeroed in on the biggest one in front with the trees in the center and cropped out the others, it would have been more special. Just a thought. It''s still interesting, though, as is. Nice color and clarity.', '2005-04-08 00:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
