(1278689, 163332, 28909, '<td valign="top">(this is not an universal truth but...) i think if you wanted to show the M in the mountain you should have the mountain in foucus. If the subject was on the near trees and the mountain was out of the center this would be a great photo, this way is just ok</td>', '(this is not an universal truth but...) i think if you wanted to show the M in the mountain you should have the mountain in foucus. If the subject was on the near trees and the mountain was out of the center this would be a great photo, this way is just ok', '2005-04-08 06:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278690, 162398, 28909, '<td valign="top">you should''ve preserved the blue in the sky instead of turning it cyan, however it''s a very good photo (maybe less dodging in the sky?)</td>', 'you should''ve preserved the blue in the sky instead of turning it cyan, however it''s a very good photo (maybe less dodging in the sky?)', '2005-04-08 06:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278691, 162023, 6999, '<td valign="top">We need a lens or sensor clean here? Shame the basic rules prevent cloning out of those spots. Great title - made me smile straight off. This must be a hellish long exposure - just looking at that light trail across the water. The spots at the top of the travel of the eye are presumably the flashes of automatic cameras? I''m no fan of this very straightforward composition, though - I think I would personally have balanced it in frame more with the shell building to its right - that conjunction here leaves the entire image feeling kind of weighted to the right.</td>', 'We need a lens or sensor clean here? Shame the basic rules prevent cloning out of those spots. Great title - made me smile straight off. This must be a hellish long exposure - just looking at that light trail across the water. The spots at the top of the travel of the eye are presumably the flashes of automatic cameras? I''m no fan of this very straightforward composition, though - I think I would personally have balanced it in frame more with the shell building to its right - that conjunction here leaves the entire image feeling kind of weighted to the right.', '2005-04-08 06:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278693, 163585, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very very straightforward composition lets this down a touch perhaps - all you have is the tree, and the light on the grass behind to carry interest. I would love to see it against more of a landscape, to bring other elements to the image - and that would also help you not have to position the thing so absolutely dead centre of the frame.</td>', 'Very very straightforward composition lets this down a touch perhaps - all you have is the tree, and the light on the grass behind to carry interest. I would love to see it against more of a landscape, to bring other elements to the image - and that would also help you not have to position the thing so absolutely dead centre of the frame.', '2005-04-08 06:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278696, 162382, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this very much - great sense of simplicity, great use of light, great timing of exposure to blur the water. The composition is nicely balanced, nicely weighted, and the tonality works really well for me. To keep the level of detail whilst only using a fifth of the available file size is impressive - though there are obvious compression artefacts along the railings of the bridge.</td>', 'I like this very much - great sense of simplicity, great use of light, great timing of exposure to blur the water. The composition is nicely balanced, nicely weighted, and the tonality works really well for me. To keep the level of detail whilst only using a fifth of the available file size is impressive - though there are obvious compression artefacts along the railings of the bridge.', '2005-04-08 06:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278697, 163608, 6999, '<td valign="top">Or Y, or X perhaps. I like the feel here, there''s a sense of washed-out-ness to it all, without losing definition on the right-hand plane, which gives the whole thing a mystical kind of quality. I''m not wholly sure that the framing couldn''t have been better - stronger - had you placed the vertical smoke and plane more strongly in frame. But it''s an effective image, nevertheless.</td>', 'Or Y, or X perhaps. I like the feel here, there''s a sense of washed-out-ness to it all, without losing definition on the right-hand plane, which gives the whole thing a mystical kind of quality. I''m not wholly sure that the framing couldn''t have been better - stronger - had you placed the vertical smoke and plane more strongly in frame. But it''s an effective image, nevertheless.', '2005-04-08 06:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278699, 163372, 30018, '<td valign="top">What happened to the first part of the challange, to "create and interesting photograph?" This to me, has no interest at all.  It''s not well photographed, quality wise and I think it fails the intended challenge.  &lt;3&gt;</td>', 'What happened to the first part of the challange, to "create and interesting photograph?" This to me, has no interest at all.  It''s not well photographed, quality wise and I think it fails the intended challenge.  <3>', '2005-04-08 06:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278700, 161598, 30018, '<td valign="top">What happened to the first part of the challange, to "create and interesting photograph?" And the key word "Accidental" doesn''t seem to fit here.  In fact, it almost looks staged.  &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'What happened to the first part of the challange, to "create and interesting photograph?" And the key word "Accidental" doesn''t seem to fit here.  In fact, it almost looks staged.  <4>', '2005-04-08 06:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278701, 163470, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but seems to lack detail which is lost in the hot spots.  My eye is drawn to the details in the trees in the background rather than the main object.  Interesting "Y" however. &lt;5&gt;</td>', 'Interesting image, but seems to lack detail which is lost in the hot spots.  My eye is drawn to the details in the trees in the background rather than the main object.  Interesting "Y" however. <5>', '2005-04-08 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1278703, 163585, 30018, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image, but one of the many in this challenge that don''t seem to be "well photographed".  I''m affraid many images in this challenge were created with the "letter" in mind and everyone tossed out the window everything they had learned about photography.  Although you have captured a "letter" in nature, I''m sorry, but I find this photo uninteresting to look at. &lt;4&gt;</td>', 'This is an interesting image, but one of the many in this challenge that don''t seem to be "well photographed".  I''m affraid many images in this challenge were created with the "letter" in mind and everyone tossed out the window everything they had learned about photography.  Although you have captured a "letter" in nature, I''m sorry, but I find this photo uninteresting to look at. <4>', '2005-04-08 06:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
