(1278714, 163267, 30018, '<td valign="top">Okay, please forgive me, but I''m not seeing a "letter" here at all.  I''ve looked at this one several times, backed away from the monitor, and looked at it from different angles.  The best I can do is an upside down lower case ''q''.  This, however is one of the very best images, quality-wise in the challenge, with great lighting, marvelous detail ( a little loss in the center white area, but that could be my monitor), and an interesting composition, which most of the other images lack.  I know there has to be a letter in there somewhere, so giving you that benefit of the doubt, and based on the quality of the photo, I''m giving it my praises.  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'Okay, please forgive me, but I''m not seeing a "letter" here at all.  I''ve looked at this one several times, backed away from the monitor, and looked at it from different angles.  The best I can do is an upside down lower case ''q''.  This, however is one of the very best images, quality-wise in the challenge, with great lighting, marvelous detail ( a little loss in the center white area, but that could be my monitor), and an interesting composition, which most of the other images lack.  I know there has to be a letter in there somewhere, so giving you that benefit of the doubt, and based on the quality of the photo, I''m giving it my praises.  <9>', '2005-04-08 06:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
