(1281028, 163686, 36188, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the title clue, but I''m still looking for the N. Too complicated for me.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the title clue, but I''m still looking for the N. Too complicated for me.', '2005-04-09 17:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
