(1281048, 163587, 36188, '<td valign="top">Don''t like this picture even if it is a real B. Looks like the Pretzel is pressed up against a rather dirty window, so I guess the hygiene is not so great either.</td>', 'Don''t like this picture even if it is a real B. Looks like the Pretzel is pressed up against a rather dirty window, so I guess the hygiene is not so great either.', '2005-04-09 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
