(1281052, 163410, 36188, '<td valign="top">This is a nice study, especially of the gulls. I would have liked to see more of the background rocks (which look interesting) and less of the foreground sand/mud.</td>', 'This is a nice study, especially of the gulls. I would have liked to see more of the background rocks (which look interesting) and less of the foreground sand/mud.', '2005-04-09 17:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1281054, 162236, 21611, '<td valign="top">a little out of focus and hard to imagine the letter but an interesting perspective non the less.. keep shooting!</td>', 'a little out of focus and hard to imagine the letter but an interesting perspective non the less.. keep shooting!', '2005-04-09 17:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1281057, 163454, 36188, '<td valign="top">Clever use of shadow, otherwise a little boring. Where does the title TEA fit in?<br/>Am I missing something obvious? Why not just T.</td>', 'Clever use of shadow, otherwise a little boring. Where does the title TEA fit in?Am I missing something obvious? Why not just T.', '2005-04-09 17:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1281058, 162986, 21611, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t able to see the letter.. but a very interesting shot. nice colour and detail I also like the vertical image.</td>', 'I wasn''t able to see the letter.. but a very interesting shot. nice colour and detail I also like the vertical image.', '2005-04-09 17:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1281060, 162403, 21611, '<td valign="top">Shocking but stii no "accidental" letters.. IMO did not meet the challenge but you definately got my attention</td>', 'Shocking but stii no "accidental" letters.. IMO did not meet the challenge but you definately got my attention', '2005-04-09 17:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
