(1284298, 163410, 19010, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to find it.. Thats your job in this challenge.. Just show it too me... Just kidding.. great shot.. Great capture at just the right moment to get the shot.  But it did take me a moment to find the birds letter. Nice job</td>', 'I don''t want to find it.. Thats your job in this challenge.. Just show it too me... Just kidding.. great shot.. Great capture at just the right moment to get the shot.  But it did take me a moment to find the birds letter. Nice job', '2005-04-11 15:11:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284302, 163635, 19010, '<td valign="top">Not accidental this shot is stagged!! does not fit the challenge!!!... ummm that is if I can prove that you made the T in the T-bone... Great job with the stagged yet completly accedental letter. Fun shot and very well done... great job. 8</td>', 'Not accidental this shot is stagged!! does not fit the challenge!!!... ummm that is if I can prove that you made the T in the T-bone... Great job with the stagged yet completly accedental letter. Fun shot and very well done... great job. 8', '2005-04-11 15:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284311, 162042, 27845, '<td valign="top">Why does your model look asleep? Was shooting that boring or is this an unfortunate snaoshot? Anyways, this is not what I understand as accidental. It looks as if your model hekd your hand like that with the purpose to form an L, and for that purpose only. Thus, your letter is (or at least looks) not accidental. Technically, your model is too important an element to be out of focus. 3.</td>', 'Why does your model look asleep? Was shooting that boring or is this an unfortunate snaoshot? Anyways, this is not what I understand as accidental. It looks as if your model hekd your hand like that with the purpose to form an L, and for that purpose only. Thus, your letter is (or at least looks) not accidental. Technically, your model is too important an element to be out of focus. 3.', '2005-04-11 15:21:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284312, 161690, 27845, '<td valign="top">Too many lines in here to make any letters discernable. I think I see an X and a Z, but, they''re just too hard to see. 3.</td>', 'Too many lines in here to make any letters discernable. I think I see an X and a Z, but, they''re just too hard to see. 3.', '2005-04-11 15:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284316, 163336, 27845, '<td valign="top">Cool, very nice. The only problem I have with this picture is the hands. They look too set up. It reminds of a dancing pose (flamenco or so) but it''s too obvious they were formed to make a Y. Technically perfect, the crop is a little too tight at the bottom though. 10.</td>', 'Cool, very nice. The only problem I have with this picture is the hands. They look too set up. It reminds of a dancing pose (flamenco or so) but it''s too obvious they were formed to make a Y. Technically perfect, the crop is a little too tight at the bottom though. 10.', '2005-04-11 15:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284318, 163419, 27845, '<td valign="top">Your crop us too tight, and your e should be sharper, it looks out of ficus. 5.</td>', 'Your crop us too tight, and your e should be sharper, it looks out of ficus. 5.', '2005-04-11 15:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
