(1287142, 163677, 27735, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aerogurl:</b></div><hr/><i> congrats on your first well deserved ribbon.  I still think your self portrait should have scored higher ;)  well done! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, Dana, and thanks for the comment left on my self portrait. I really didn''t expect this photo to do so well. I went to the park and took a ton of nature shots, but wasn''t impressed with any of them. Then I drove downtown to look for some "letters" around the capital and I took "bluE-grEEn" right after I stepped out of the car. And that was it, didn''t even walk over to the capital.</td>', 'Originally posted by aerogurl: congrats on your first well deserved ribbon.  I still think your self portrait should have scored higher ;)  well done!   Thank you, Dana, and thanks for the comment left on my self portrait. I really didn''t expect this photo to do so well. I went to the park and took a ton of nature shots, but wasn''t impressed with any of them. Then I drove downtown to look for some "letters" around the capital and I took "bluE-grEEn" right after I stepped out of the car. And that was it, didn''t even walk over to the capital.', '2005-04-13 02:02:54.000000', NULL, 0),
