(1287237, 162073, 33542, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who left me comments. I wanted to quickly explain the "M"... A lot of people suggested this looked more like a W (or a sigma? hmm...), but when I first saw it I was walking from the right side of the frame so it looked like an M to me then and it just got stuck in my mind that way.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who left me comments. I wanted to quickly explain the "M"... A lot of people suggested this looked more like a W (or a sigma? hmm...), but when I first saw it I was walking from the right side of the frame so it looked like an M to me then and it just got stuck in my mind that way.', '2005-04-13 02:33:53.000000', NULL, 0),
