(1287341, 162986, 18367, '<td valign="top">I have to admit that I was one of the people that had difficulty finding the letters in the photograph and that may have been the root cause of your problems.  <br/> <br/>You might have considered cropping out the windows on the right hand side, as well as the large cement bench at the forefront, since both are very distracting. Reducing the amount of wall shown on the left might have helped also.<br/> <br/>I did really like the colour contrast and the sharpness of the photo.<br/> <br/>Good luck to you in your future submissions.<br/> <br/>Ray</td>', 'I have to admit that I was one of the people that had difficulty finding the letters in the photograph and that may have been the root cause of your problems.   You might have considered cropping out the windows on the right hand side, as well as the large cement bench at the forefront, since both are very distracting. Reducing the amount of wall shown on the left might have helped also. I did really like the colour contrast and the sharpness of the photo. Good luck to you in your future submissions. Ray', '2005-04-13 03:01:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(1287382, 162023, 9668, '<td valign="top">Very nice image and congrats on the win! I''d like to see a study (over a weekend or so, a few hours every evening) of what time and what location the flashes went off at. I would think that they most often go off round sunset, and as your shot shows, at the top of the wheel. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice image and congrats on the win! I''d like to see a study (over a weekend or so, a few hours every evening) of what time and what location the flashes went off at. I would think that they most often go off round sunset, and as your shot shows, at the top of the wheel. Well done!', '2005-04-13 03:27:30.000000', NULL, 0),
