(1287478, 163488, 8860, '<td valign="top">Strong image (and it''s not a letter formed only by cropping). I didn''t get the crucifixion reference though. Grain doesn''t bother me either.<br/> <br/>Edit: The haloing could be prevented by sharpening your shot in Lab colour mode on the ''Lightness'' channel only.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-13 05:37:27.</i></td>', 'Strong image (and it''s not a letter formed only by cropping). I didn''t get the crucifixion reference though. Grain doesn''t bother me either. Edit: The haloing could be prevented by sharpening your shot in Lab colour mode on the ''Lightness'' channel only.', '2005-04-13 04:16:31.000000', '2005-04-13 06:37:27.000000', 0),
