(1287898, 162023, 13113, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I love it. I didn''t get done with all my voting so I didn''t see this one but if I did you would have gotten a ten from me. Nice colors and nice contrast. Nice choice for the shoot. Congrats on first!</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I love it. I didn''t get done with all my voting so I didn''t see this one but if I did you would have gotten a ten from me. Nice colors and nice contrast. Nice choice for the shoot. Congrats on first!', '2005-04-13 08:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
