(1289426, 163540, 8891, '<td valign="top">You got entirely too many 1 to 3 votes for an image as good as this and with no real negative comments, well maybe one for the crop, you''ll never know why...guess a lot people thought your would win and you got trolled...disgusting. Big congrats on your top five finish!</td>', 'You got entirely too many 1 to 3 votes for an image as good as this and with no real negative comments, well maybe one for the crop, you''ll never know why...guess a lot people thought your would win and you got trolled...disgusting. Big congrats on your top five finish!', '2005-04-13 17:19:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(1289433, 162747, 32754, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the votes above 5..I''m glad some people liked this; it was geometric and unusual so I figured it might be in trouble!  Three of you gave me 10 and two a 9..thank you !!!</td>', 'Thanks for all the votes above 5..I''m glad some people liked this; it was geometric and unusual so I figured it might be in trouble!  Three of you gave me 10 and two a 9..thank you !!!', '2005-04-13 17:21:22.000000', NULL, 0),
