(1291843, 162023, 33560, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I''m imressed with the patience and the sense of play that  led to getting the right shot.  Thanks for explaining.<br/> <br/>When I saw this shot I experienced a strong sense of deja vu .  Anyone else who experienced the same might be trying to figure out why may wish to visit <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=48814." rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=48814.</a> Both images share many common strenghths.  I find it instructive to compare the compositions and the techniques.</td>', 'Great shot.  I''m imressed with the patience and the sense of play that  led to getting the right shot.  Thanks for explaining. When I saw this shot I experienced a strong sense of deja vu .  Anyone else who experienced the same might be trying to figure out why may wish to visit //www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=48814. Both images share many common strenghths.  I find it instructive to compare the compositions and the techniques.', '2005-04-14 13:53:53.000000', NULL, 0),
