(1298619, 162023, 36453, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nfessel:</b></div><hr/><i> i have a difficult time seeing a Q here. takes some interpretation to figure it out. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You see that big circle thing...with the sort of ''slash'' in the bottom right quarter?  Well, in the American Alphabet that makes a ''Q''.</td>', 'Originally posted by nfessel: i have a difficult time seeing a Q here. takes some interpretation to figure it out.   You see that big circle thing...with the sort of ''slash'' in the bottom right quarter?  Well, in the American Alphabet that makes a ''Q''.', '2005-04-17 22:08:44.000000', NULL, 0),
