(1693824, 163482, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is really an amazing shot.  The focus is tack sharp and the colors are nice and vivid without being unnatural.  Phenomenal scenery - my only minor criticism would be that the horizon seems tilted to me (and not in the good artsy way).  I think if you were to straighten that and maybe crop a hair off the bottom to remove the piece of visible dirt between the trees that this shot would just about be perfect!  Really great capture - I scored it an 8 during the challenge.</td>', 'This is really an amazing shot.  The focus is tack sharp and the colors are nice and vivid without being unnatural.  Phenomenal scenery - my only minor criticism would be that the horizon seems tilted to me (and not in the good artsy way).  I think if you were to straighten that and maybe crop a hair off the bottom to remove the piece of visible dirt between the trees that this shot would just about be perfect!  Really great capture - I scored it an 8 during the challenge.', '2005-09-10 22:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1840647, 163659, 40667, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I love the use of B&amp;W in this particular shot! Like the shaddows, in this case, they do not disrupt the image at all, but add to it!</td>', 'Very nice! I love the use of B&W in this particular shot! Like the shaddows, in this case, they do not disrupt the image at all, but add to it!', '2005-11-05 16:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
