(2413827, 163659, 40679, '<td valign="top">again I''m commenting on a photo of yours (thread "need comments")... is it a coincidence? ;-)<br/> <br/>in the "Pick your favorite pic from the person above you"-thread I told you I liked this one a lot. You didn''t believe me. Now it''s time to tell you why :D<br/> <br/>when looking at the challenge, this is just perfect. There''s a very obvious Q, at first you woudn''t even know it''s a teapot. the simplicity &amp; angle of this shot is just great. I do think when the background was really dark black, it would''ve been perfect in all ways.</td>', 'again I''m commenting on a photo of yours (thread "need comments")... is it a coincidence? ;-) in the "Pick your favorite pic from the person above you"-thread I told you I liked this one a lot. You didn''t believe me. Now it''s time to tell you why :D when looking at the challenge, this is just perfect. There''s a very obvious Q, at first you woudn''t even know it''s a teapot. the simplicity & angle of this shot is just great. I do think when the background was really dark black, it would''ve been perfect in all ways.', '2006-05-14 06:06:14.000000', NULL, 0),
