(3344423, 163461, 62637, '<td valign="top">Hehe, yes that was mine sandy...  and I was worried I gave myself away with my comment below ;-)<br/> <br/>And for the record, I live in Vancouver...if you look at my outtake, I never left the mountains: <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=465476" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62637/thumb/465476.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62637/thumb/465476.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/62637/thumb/465476.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Like I said, as I was walking along the beach I saw this heron, and once it let me get real close, I got rather excited at having the opportunity to get a photo like this one!  I have to say though...it is cold and windy on Vancouver beaches in January!</td>', 'Hehe, yes that was mine sandy...  and I was worried I gave myself away with my comment below ;-) And for the record, I live in Vancouver...if you look at my outtake, I never left the mountains:   Like I said, as I was walking along the beach I saw this heron, and once it let me get real close, I got rather excited at having the opportunity to get a photo like this one!  I have to say though...it is cold and windy on Vancouver beaches in January!', '2007-02-08 13:34:51.000000', NULL, 0),
